    <questionnote format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>\(\displaystyle \int_{{@lower_lmt@}}^{{@upper_lmt@}}\frac{{@num@}}{v}\,dv\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \int_{{@lower_lmt@}}^{0}\frac{{@num@}}{v}\,dv={@num@}({@ta1@})\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \int_{0}^{{@upper_lmt@}}\frac{{@num@}}{v}\,dv={@num@}({@ta2@})\)</p>
<p>Therefore, the integral is {@mcq_correct(ta_3)[1]@}</p>]]></text>
    </questionnote>
